Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:08.19,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Hey! Ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:12.29,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh! I knew you'd be here, Ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:14.37,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,I looked everywhere for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:16.99,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh? You in the middle of somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.51,0:00:19.34,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:22.00,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I almost lost my mind back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.\NWhat's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:26.43,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh, right, right. What's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.43,0:00:28.87,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,You know, that third-year girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.87,0:00:30.05,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,The really cute one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.77,0:00:31.76,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Cute...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:34.34,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Kikukawa-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:37.40,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,You had plans to hang out with \Nher after school today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.82,0:00:41.52,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,You left her on read, so \NI had to come and look for you like—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sentaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:45.30,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:47.21,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Th-The Prince?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:48.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:54.28,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Please don't pull this kind \Nof thing on me ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.72,0:01:00.66,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,H-Huh? Th-The P-Pri—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:02.60,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well then, good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.79,0:01:07.37,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:09.10,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's goin' on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.75,0:01:12.78,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He's the Prince, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.78,0:01:14.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He must be very popular indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.65,0:01:18.38,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,"Cute," my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.71,0:01:21.69,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I knew he was saying it to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.30,0:01:27.57,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm getting \Nfooled by those cheap words.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.03,0:03:00.03,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\b1\fnComic Sans MS\bord0\c&HD2E3EE&\frz7.256\frx18\fry346\pos(333.334,30)}Curry Diner
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.03,0:03:00.03,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs11\b1\fnComic Sans MS\bord0\c&HD2E3EE&\frx18\fry346\frz6.135\pos(335.334,53)}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:01.99,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:05.85,Default,MIDDLE-AGED MALE CUSTOMER,0,0,0,,Oh ho, you got those roses flying \Nagain today, huh, Yoi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.85,0:03:07.99,Default,YAMADA-SAN,0,0,0,,Must be nice.\NI want some of those, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:10.29,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi, can you handle the register?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:11.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:16.71,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me, but you're... \Na girl, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:18.28,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:19.81,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER,0,0,0,,Really?! Oh wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:22.18,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER,0,0,0,,I bet you're always being told how \Nhandsome you are, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.93,0:03:27.97,flashback,MIDDLE SCHOOL GIRL 1,0,0,0,,The Prince is so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.97,0:03:29.68,flashback,MIDDLE SCHOOL GIRL 2,0,0,0,,Such a hottie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.09,0:03:32.19,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:34.40,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're just cute, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:37.42,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I know he's probably \Nsaying it to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.09,0:03:41.17,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But that was a first for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:44.79,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,To be called "cute" by a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:47.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome... in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:48.58,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:50.54,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-What're you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.15,0:03:53.37,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wait, are you really stalking me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:55.18,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:55.88,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:57.70,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I get some curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:03.43,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Two customers coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:09.07,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.07,0:04:10.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, looks good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:12.62,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,You guys are from Yoi's school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:14.10,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,I'll bump the size up for you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.10,0:04:15.12,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:16.31,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:19.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Why are you telling everyone \Nthat we run a curry place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.33,0:04:21.24,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I didn't tell anyone. He figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:26.32,flashback,SENTARO,0,0,0,,That's... That's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:28.58,flashback,SENTARO,0,0,0,,That's the place in the \Ncurry restaurant hot spot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:30.53,flashback,SENTARO,0,0,0,,that sells curry, coffee, and records!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.53,0:04:33.13,flashback,SENTARO,0,0,0,,The novelty store, Nasu Oyaji Curry, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:38.47,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,He's a hardcore curry fanatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:40.59,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:42.80,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.57,0:04:48.68,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,And? Which one is your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Dad, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:52.81,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Well, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:57.31,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,The only men I've ever seen you \Nspeak to are me and our patrons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:05:00.27,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,I've never heard you speak about \Nany favorite actors or idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:04.94,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,That's why I'm relieved to see \Nyou actually talking to boys
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.94,0:05:06.36,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,the same age as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:10.45,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It crossed my mind before,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:14.91,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,but he really does look like \Nhe enjoys his food while he eats...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.35,0:05:19.63,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, not good. I'm staring again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.55,0:05:21.70,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,So strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:24.84,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Phew, I'm stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:27.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, I'm seriously startin' to doze.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.23,0:05:30.41,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Well, I wanna wrap up this review, \Nso I'm headin' home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:32.77,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Let's see... Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.77,0:05:36.57,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Right! Here's the money, and this is \Nmy social media account for curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:36.57,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H33649C&\bord0\fnArial Black\fs12\frz348.3\pos(370,186)\frx32\fry356}Sentaro Akane
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.97,0:05:38.71,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Thanks for today, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:40.81,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,The food was great, Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:42.56,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Right, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:45.60,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, your friend went home, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:47.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm, just a little bit longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:49.74,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What is he, drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:53.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:55.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,When do you get off work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:57.12,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I want to walk you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:02.90,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I can't just... leave work like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:09.48,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi, you're good for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.48,0:06:11.14,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,I'll clock you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:13.35,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What?! Wh-Why would you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.98,0:06:16.99,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it! \NJust be home by nine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.99,0:06:18.56,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.79,0:06:22.75,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Jeez... Are you not worried \Nabout your own daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:23.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You guys are tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.07,0:06:26.36,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's a nice store. Your curry place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.23,0:06:30.32,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.54,0:06:43.15,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,So, um... how did your thing go, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:45.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Hanging out after school...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:47.80,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, I passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:50.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What? Wh-Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:53.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No reason. I wasn't really \Ninto it to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.83,0:06:56.99,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Besides, it was more important \Nto deliver the thing you left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.99,0:07:00.48,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Y-You could have done that any other time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:04.42,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's not good to break a promise you made \Nto a woman over something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:07.55,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Something funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:11.28,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I was just thinking... \Nyou're such a prince, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.40,0:07:15.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.91,0:07:17.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,About lunch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:23.30,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you were annoyed, \Nso I came to properly apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:25.45,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But it looks like \NI just made you upset again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.87,0:07:29.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:33.01,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,When he just apologizes like that, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.65,0:07:37.37,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't mad or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:40.34,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Even at lunch today, I wasn't angry \Nbecause I was bothered...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.01,0:07:42.48,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,More like...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.81,0:07:45.15,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? How should I put...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:45.94,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:51.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Aw, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:53.15,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We should find cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:54.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:56.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Can you run?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.03,0:07:57.26,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.22,0:08:03.61,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:06.59,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't just—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:09.08,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's all right. I live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:12.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're gonna catch a cold, \Nso come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.13,0:08:17.89,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,H-Hey... What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:19.58,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Here, something to change into.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:21.59,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's just some of my old clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:23.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,The bathroom is out \Nand to the left, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.28,0:08:29.36,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,U-Um, Senpai, what exactly \Nis this house of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:32.24,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, my grandpa is president of a company.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:35.45,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,P-President...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.53,0:08:39.45,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I think Nobara \Nsaid something similar, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:43.62,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Even so, he doesn't have \Nthat kind of presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:45.75,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He just had a normal bread \Nroll for lunch, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.47,0:08:47.56,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.31,0:08:52.42,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, thank you for the clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:54.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It just naturally looks good on you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:58.41,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I like that about you, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:01.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm just kiddin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:03.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'll get us some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:08.05,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Looking over it again,\Nthis place is really something...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:10.52,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And... are we the only ones here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:14.84,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,So this is what they meant \Nwhen they called you a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.84,0:09:17.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah. Stupid, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:20.99,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Calling me a prince because \Nmy family is rich is just dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.99,0:09:21.74,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\pos(495.385,98.615)\frx24\fry350\frz347}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.53,0:09:23.37,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't care that they say it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.74,0:09:21.87,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\frx24\fry350\frz343.6\pos(502.154,98.615)}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:21.99,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\frx20\fry356\pos(515.077,101.077)\frz340}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.99,0:09:22.12,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\frx10\fry4\pos(527.385,101.692)\frz337.6}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:22.87,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\frx6\fry20\pos(541.539,104.153)\frz334.1}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.87,0:09:23.00,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\frx20\fry356\frz347\pos(510.102,103.641)}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:23.12,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\frz350.9\frx20\fry350\pos(492.923,95.641)}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:23.25,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\frx28\fry332\frz2.651\pos(464.615,99.846)}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:23.37,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\frz4.598\frx34\fry322\pos(455.948,93.846)}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.37,0:09:27.46,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,but it's a real bother when \Nit draws unwanted attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.37,0:09:24.00,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\frx34\fry324\pos(449.846,88.41)\frz5.35}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:24.12,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\frx28\fry332\pos(458.461,89.385)\frz1.817}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.12,0:09:24.25,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\frx28\fry332\frz356\pos(470.154,91.846)}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:24.37,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\frz351.4\frx26\fry342\pos(481.231,93.077)}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.37,0:09:27.46,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\b1\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F576A&\pos(495.385,98.615)\frx24\fry350\frz347}Seasoned Seaweed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:30.37,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That's why at school I try \Nto keep it on the DL.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:32.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:36.61,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Maybe he has his own set of problems, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:40.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That senpai I declined \Ntoday is that exact type.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:44.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,The whole "promise" was something \Nshe just decided for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.48,0:09:47.74,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You can just tell when \Nthey're gonna be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:50.15,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:54.90,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,It's not good to break a promise you made \Nto a woman over something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:58.32,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:03.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for scolding you \Nwhen I didn't have the full picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:05.87,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Come on, you don't gotta \Napologize like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:10.00,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,And like I said, I was already \Nputting you in a tough spot, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:12.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well... I wouldn't say {\i1}that{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:19.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm really just not used to\Ninteracting with men.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:25.68,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And I didn't want you to find that out, \Nso it all came out sounding cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.57,0:10:32.34,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's the first time a man has \Never approached me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:36.11,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm just not sure how to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:37.80,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:48.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,And this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:52.78,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:11:00.26,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? Why... can't I move?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:04.42,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, yes! Picking up right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.82,0:11:03.93,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnArial Black\fs10\c&HDFEEF8&\frz15.89\pos(488.001,56.154)}Incoming Call
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.82,0:11:03.93,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnArial Black\fs15\c&HDFEEF8&\pos(493.539,75.231)\frz14.06}Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:04.05,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnArial Black\fs10\c&HDFEEF8&\pos(377.232,75.231)\frz17.63}Incoming Call
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:04.05,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnArial Black\fs15\c&HDFEEF8&\pos(384.616,94.308)\frz15.89}Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.05,0:11:06.18,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnArial Black\fs10\c&HDFEEF8&\pos(269.54,101.693)\frz18.52}Incoming Call
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.05,0:11:06.18,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnArial Black\fs15\c&HDFEEF8&\pos(276.924,120.154)\frz16.13}Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:06.18,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No way, it's already this late?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:08.55,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:09.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:11.15,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'll take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:20.58,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, I won't tell anyone \Nabout your house...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:22.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, it's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:24.75,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We rent a place \Nelsewhere to act as a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.94,0:11:28.50,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Though it's a condo registered \Nunder my grandpa's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:30.84,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,S-Such entitlement...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.18,0:11:34.57,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Is it really okay for you \Nto be telling me all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.57,0:11:35.94,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,With you, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:39.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Even if you wanted to kill me,\N I'd let it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:44.18,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Isn't it kind of nice that \Nthe last thing I'd get to see
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,would be something so beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:49.14,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're\Nlaying it on a bit thick?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:50.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah, I was just kiddin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.61,0:11:54.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You gotta call me out, \Nor I really sound crazy, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:04.91,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:07.55,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't want \Nme to walk {\i1}you{\i0} halfway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.55,0:12:09.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That makes me taking you\Nhome pointless, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.37,0:12:11.97,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Take care, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.06,0:12:13.91,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:16.92,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Kohaku Ichimura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:18.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That's my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.12,0:12:25.14,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I previously said my feelings for \Nyou were "different from love."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:27.35,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But I take that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:31.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I think it's pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:36.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well then, see ya tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:43.76,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Just when I think I've \Nfigured him out,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:48.03,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,he slips through my fingers and \Nbecomes something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:51.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He's like the reflection \Nof the moon on the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:55.62,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Kohaku. Kohaku Ichimura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:13:01.54,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,In spite of myself, I started thinking, \N"That's a nice name."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:08.35,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.48,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,What's going on with you \Nand Ichimura-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.48,0:13:13.31,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh... Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.31,0:13:14.74,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "Oh?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.74,0:13:17.27,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,We're gonna make you \Nspit it all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:18.75,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:21.17,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Ichimura-senpai is hitting on you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:23.87,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say he's {\i1}hitting on{\i0} me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:26.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,More like, he kind of follows me around...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.27,0:13:28.79,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,That's still amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.79,0:13:33.79,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,The orthodox Prince and the assertive, \Nunconventional Prince, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:35.53,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,It's all coming together!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.53,0:13:36.73,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:39.16,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You know, I {\i1}am{\i0} a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.16,0:13:42.62,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Still, for someone who's shy and \Ninexperienced in love like you, Yoi-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.62,0:13:45.15,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,maybe someone who's assertive and \Nexperienced is better?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:47.05,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.05,0:13:49.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Besides, I don't do well with \Npeople like that to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:50.78,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Get serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:55.58,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,The initial dislike just makes it spicier \Ndown the line, Prince Takiguichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:56.81,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yep. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:14:02.03,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,But I heard Ichimura-senpai was \Npretty indifferent towards girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.03,0:14:02.82,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,so it's surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:04.37,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.37,0:14:07.21,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yeah. So it might be {\i1}that{\i0} when \Nit comes to you, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:08.09,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,"That"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.09,0:14:11.28,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,You know... like {\i1}fate{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,N-No, no, it's definitely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.61,0:14:16.20,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:17.75,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,You never know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:18.98,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:22.58,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,My image of him has changed a lot \Nfrom my first impression...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:25.05,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And I'm starting to understand \Nthat he isn't all that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:27.96,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Still, saying it's "fate"...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:30.52,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That's jumping the gun, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.85,0:14:35.56,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm not even sure \Nhow serious he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.85,0:14:37.53,Default,HALLWAY GIRL A,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that the prince?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:38.69,Default,HALLWAY GIRL B,0,0,0,,What, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:40.68,Default,HALLWAY GIRL A AND B,0,0,0,,Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.86,0:14:45.14,Default,SECOND YEAR GIRL A,0,0,0,,Kohaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:49.57,Default,SECOND YEAR GIRL A,0,0,0,,I heard you stood up Kikukawa-senpai \Nthe other day. That true?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:51.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.09,0:14:53.06,Default,SECOND YEAR GIRL A,0,0,0,,Come hang out with us, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:56.66,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? I've been pretty busy lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:58.25,Default,SECOND YEAR GIRL A,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.25,0:15:01.05,Default,SECOND YEAR GIRL A,0,0,0,,It's about the first-year \NPrince that he's totally into!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.05,0:15:03.28,Default,SECOND YEAR GIRL B,0,0,0,,What, for real?! Did he change types?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:06.05,Default,SECOND YEAR GIRL A,0,0,0,,Right?! She's pretty and all, \Nbut that's a nuh-uh from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.05,0:15:09.91,Default,SECOND YEAR GIRL A,0,0,0,,'Cause she's totally a guy \Nat first glance! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.87,0:15:09.91,top,SECOND YEAR GIRL B,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:12.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You guys are looking \Npretty ugly right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.94,0:15:14.80,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Didja know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:19.13,Default,SECOND YEAR GIRL A,0,0,0,,What an ass. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:23.55,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh, man, that was pretty harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:25.75,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Why? It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.75,0:15:27.79,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,You know, I've been thinking \Nthis for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:30.73,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,but you're pretty cold towards \Ngirls, aren't you, Ichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:31.99,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Isn't that normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:36.71,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Actually, I was wondering the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:38.73,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Why {\i1}are{\i0} you so obsessed \Nwith the first-year Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.98,0:15:41.81,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,I was wondering that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:44.14,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,She's the total opposite\Nof the girls you usually date.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.85,0:15:50.80,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Seriously? I'm wondering why\N everyone else {\i1}isn't{\i0} interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:55.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,First of all, she looks like {\i1}that{\i0} \Nbut she's a girl, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.67,0:15:58.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That alone makes you \Nsuper curious, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:16:02.28,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Like how she usually acts, or how she \Nacts when she's talking to a guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.28,0:16:04.07,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,or what's it like if she \Ntakes off her clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:04.77,top,SHUN,0,0,0,,That's sexual harassment, right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.06,0:16:07.41,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Come on, that's just you being horny!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.41,0:16:08.27,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.27,0:16:12.24,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Man, I thought it was unusual for \Nyou to be making the first move, Ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:13.93,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,It's just impure thoughts motivating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:15.33,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Impure, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:19.62,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Huh? Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:20.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Skipping class.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:22.29,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to repeat a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:24.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Princes don't repeat years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:25.56,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Yes they do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.49,0:16:27.38,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Seriously, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:30.03,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Why isn't anyone else curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.43,0:16:31.92,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,For something that beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:34.63,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,anyone would stop and stare for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.78,0:16:36.26,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wouldn't anyone want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:42.44,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,How can a desire to know more about it, \Nto have it, be impure? Isn't it natural?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.97,0:16:44.98,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.73,0:16:47.84,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:49.45,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I suddenly got the chills...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:51.03,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:54.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'll just go to the nurse's \Noffice and get some medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.25,0:16:55.39,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.79,0:17:01.99,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Th-That's not entirely true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.99,0:17:04.66,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Actually, I've had a slight \Nfever since this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:08.17,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I can feel it rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.76,0:17:11.25,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's probably from {\i0}that{\i1}.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:14.38,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,For now, I'll just get something \Nto reduce the fever and—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:16.22,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:21.29,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That's pretty low, don't ya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:22.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You didn't have to slam the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:23.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Please let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:25.94,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I really don't want to \Ndeal with you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:30.25,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't look okay.\NYou good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:31.56,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Is it a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.56,0:17:32.65,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:34.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'll be all right on my own, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:36.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Please leave me be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.11,0:17:49.64,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Just ask for help when you're down, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.27,0:17:53.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You don't have to be a prince \Nin front of me, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.11,0:17:58.09,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.51,0:18:02.26,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You good? Can you stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.52,0:18:04.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Please don't worry... about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.15,0:18:07.30,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,For now, just lie down for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.91,0:18:09.37,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'll get the teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.37,0:18:10.53,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sorry for the trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:20.45,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He's really never done \Nanything that bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:24.42,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's just not being honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:28.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry, the teach's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.07,0:18:31.85,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Why are you getting in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.85,0:18:35.30,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I thought you might \Nneed someone to keep you warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:36.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Like a co-sleeping thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:39.39,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, I don't! Please get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:41.47,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,See, what'd I tell ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:43.36,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:46.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, jokes aside, come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.78,0:18:49.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:52.77,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.77,0:18:55.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm... Then I'll get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:00.32,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,H-Hey, what are you—!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:03.24,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's okay, it's okay, rest time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.91,0:19:06.99,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,If only I had my strength back...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.99,0:19:07.87,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:10.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Rely on me a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:12.46,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Trust me a bit, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.34,0:19:15.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm not {\i1}that{\i0} desperate, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:20.86,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Once I'm better, you're \Ngonna pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:24.33,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Once you're better, \Nfeel free to do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.79,0:19:27.64,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You should've stayed home if you \Nhad a fever in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:30.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I've never been absent from school, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:31.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No way. Not even once?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:32.42,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:35.03,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,For real? You're seriously \Na model student.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:36.14,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,A different scent from a girl's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:38.89,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You're warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:40.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.57,0:19:43.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,My body temperature's naturally high.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:45.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Makes me cute like a cat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.42,0:19:47.70,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Cats are...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.39,0:19:50.95,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:00.58,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, we slept so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:01.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We slept {\i1}too{\i0} long!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:03.97,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What should I do?\NI skipped sixth period!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.97,0:20:06.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You weren't going to make it\Nwith that fever anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:06.51,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Still!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:08.14,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,How's the fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:09.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Feelin' sluggish?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:12.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I think I'm feeling much better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.78,0:20:14.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Okay. Then I'll take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.62,0:20:15.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:17.24,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'll get my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:19.21,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:25.07,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? My bag...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.03,0:20:29.26,italics,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.03,0:20:34.75,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs16\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H202D35&\frx2\fry356\move(158,360,158,240,0,6703)\frz348.8}Yoi-chan,\N\N\N\N\N\N\NYou didn't come back,\N\N\N\N\N\Nso we came to check on you, and oh my what a sight.\N\N\N\N\NI'll just leave your things here.\N\N\N\N\N\NWe want to hear the deets tomorrow, okay?\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\h\h\h\h\hKotobuki
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.71,0:20:33.78,italics,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,You didn't come back, so we came to \Ncheck on you, and oh my what a sight.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.20,0:20:36.46,italics,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,I'll just leave your things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:37.96,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0\c&H1A2932&\pos(358.667,80)\frx12\fry0\frz354.8}You guys sure were sound asleep
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:37.96,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0\c&H1A2932&\pos(218,209.333)\frx20\fry0\frz356.2}Nobara
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.08,0:20:37.96,italicstop,NOBARA,0,0,0,,You guys sure were sound asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.73,0:20:39.25,italics,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,We want to hear the deets tomorrow, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:43.34,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What am I even doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:48.79,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Say, I'm starving.\NYou wanna grab something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.79,0:20:51.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No. I'm heading straight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.01,0:20:51.72,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:54.14,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, the curry at your place, Yoi-chan—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.14,0:20:55.16,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm not going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:56.88,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, there's a delicious looking diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:20:57.94,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Not going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:20:59.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.47,0:21:03.92,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get used to \Ngoing home with this guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:06.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Boy, did I sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.05,0:21:07.91,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're real comfortable \Nto sleep with, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:12.22,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,There you go sounding \Nlike a creep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:13.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.49,0:21:15.75,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Isn't it important to find \Nsomeone comfy to sleep with?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:17.49,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.49,0:21:22.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know, they say that's how \Nyou know who your soulmate is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:26.55,flashback,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,You know... like {\i1}fate{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:30.65,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Everyone is so quick to say \Nit's fate, it's fate...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.01,0:21:33.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Does that... even really exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.91,0:21:36.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,How would you even confirm it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:37.45,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:41.52,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You wanna try going out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.77,0:21:44.89,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,To experiment?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:50.02,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm not just getting used to it...\N I'm gradually being corrupted by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.95,0:21:52.54,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I think it's pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:56.25,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder how serious he was about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.25,0:21:57.22,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Just kidd—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.22,0:21:58.12,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.68,0:22:03.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Then, would you like to try going out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.26,0:22:15.37,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(634,250)\fs15\c&H392B2C&\bord0\b1\fnComic Sans MS\t(4970,5387,\c&HFFFFFF&)\frz19.29\pos(323.334,217.333)}The Evening Downpour and the Cat
